{"title": "Golbraith's Cellar", "pageid": 27854, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Golbraith's_Cellar", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Three Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg/300px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg/450px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg/600px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg/300px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"163\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Golbraith%27s_Cellar.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Street view of Golbraith's Cellar  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<table class=\"relative-location\" style=\"float:right; width:200px; clear:right;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" class=\"relative-location-header\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloomridge_Park\" title=\"Bloomridge Park\">Bloomridge Park</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">↑\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Glitter_Gala\" title=\"The Glitter Gala\">The Glitter Gala</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">←\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%; align-items: center;\"><b>Golbraith's Cellar</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">→\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloomridge_Park\" title=\"Bloomridge Park\">Bloomridge Park</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">↓\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><b>Golbraith's Cellar</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/70px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/105px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/140px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/70px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">...before or after you thundered into my home like a wounded umber hulk? Make no mistake - you're here because I allow it.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a>, after party advised him to worry about himself</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Golbraith's Cellar</b><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is a small private house located directly across from the main gate to <a href=\"/wiki/Bloomridge_Park\" title=\"Bloomridge Park\">Bloomridge Park</a> and north of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid</a>. Though it seemingly consists of two adjacent dwellings, the door to the second one (with a separate mailbox) is blocked. The only entrance is at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-154&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-55</span>. The building is two-storied and has a spacious basement.\n</p><p>On a triangular ground outside Golbraith's Cellar three children, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cinnamon\" title=\"Cinnamon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/25px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/38px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/50px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cinnamon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/25px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cinnamon\" title=\"Cinnamon\">Cinnamon</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punkins\" title=\"Punkins\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/25px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/38px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/50px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Punkins\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/25px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punkins\" title=\"Punkins\">Punkins</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slow-Butt\" title=\"Slow-Butt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/25px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/38px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/50px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slow-Butt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/25px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slow-Butt\" title=\"Slow-Butt\">Slow-Butt</a> are playing a game, imitating citizens being detained and scanned by a Steel Watcher. The party can talk to them and participate in the game.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Layout\">Layout</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"First_floor\">First floor</span></h3>\n<p>The ground floor features a hatch leading to the basement (see below) and the ladder on the south-western corner, which leads to the first floor. However, the first floor room can also be accessed via jumping onto the balcony. \n</p><p>The upper bookshelf at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-154&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-62</span> contains a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Chest_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Chest Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Chest_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Chest Key\">key</a>. The nearby locked rustic chest, however, must be lockpicked (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) to be opened. It contains a book of letters between Golbraith and his son, some gold and a set of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thieves%27_Tools\" title=\"Thieves' Tools\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thieves%27_Tools\" title=\"Thieves' Tools\">Thieves' Tools</a>.\n</p><p>The house owner <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/25px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/38px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/50px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Golbraith Stredivas\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/25px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a> is on the first floor. He is a retired monster hunter and an expert in countering <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayers</a>. He taught his son everything he knew about his metier, but is now concerned about him. Easing his mind about the mind flayers in the city and about his son's mettle as well grants approval from most companions (the formulation depends on the interacting character's <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class\">Class</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Race\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Race\">Race</a>). If the party choose a friendly course when speaking with Golbraith, he awards them with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\">Abdel's Trusted Shield</a>. Otherwise, the shield can be pickpocketed from him, along with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Hatch_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Hatch Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Hatch_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Hatch Key\">Golbraith's Hatch Key</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Basement\">Basement</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg/300px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg/450px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg/600px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg/300px-Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Golbraith%27s_Cellar_Basement.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Basement of the house<br><small>(by Martijn Petersen)</small></figcaption></figure>\n<p>In the north-eastern corner of the room is a locked hatch which leads to the basement. It requires <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;20 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;20 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> or aforementioned hatch key stolen from Golbraith.\n</p><p>Descending through the hatch, the party first find themselves in a small cellar, where some containers may keep <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> or health potions of various grade. The western wall is movable; it is initially marked as a door and does not require any ability checks to detect.\n</p><p>Behind the wall is the main part of the basement: a spacious hall with a study, a training ground, and multiple hunting trophies along the walls. The middle part of the hall is crossed with four <a href=\"/wiki/Marble_Plate\" title=\"Marble Plate\">Marble Plates</a> which set off the <a href=\"/wiki/Vent\" title=\"Vent\">vents</a> emanating <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/30px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/40px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloudkill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\">Cloudkill</a> vapors. Each marble plate requires <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to find and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to disarm. Also, a button on the wall at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2342&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;834</span> disables all traps.\n</p><p>Containers around the room (including various vases) may keep gold, <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>, common weapons, random arrows, various potions and elixirs. The southern side of the room is a makeshift training ground. A <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Katana\" title=\"Katana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Katana\" title=\"Katana\">Katana</a> lies on a cupboard under a stuffed hyena head.\n</p><p>The northern side has a small study with several books on <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid\">Illithids</a> and ways to track and fight them. In the far end of the hall, on a weapon stand and on the table are some common and <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span> weapons. A locked gilded chest which can be opened with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Chest_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Chest Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith%27s_Chest_Key\" title=\"Golbraith's Chest Key\">Golbraith's Chest Key</a> contains gold and rare <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical</a> ingredients.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cinnamon\" title=\"Cinnamon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/30px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/45px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/60px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cinnamon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png/30px-Portrait_Cinnamon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Cinnamon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cinnamon\" title=\"Cinnamon\">Cinnamon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/30px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/45px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/60px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Golbraith Stredivas\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png/30px-Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Golbraith_Stredivas.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punkins\" title=\"Punkins\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/30px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/45px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/60px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Punkins\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png/30px-Portrait_Punkins.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Punkins.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punkins\" title=\"Punkins\">Punkins</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slow-Butt\" title=\"Slow-Butt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/30px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/45px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/60px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slow-Butt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png/30px-Portrait_Slow-Butt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Portrait_Slow-Butt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slow-Butt\" title=\"Slow-Butt\">Slow-Butt</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Abdel%27s_Trusted_Shield\" title=\"Abdel's Trusted Shield\">Abdel's Trusted Shield</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference\" title=\"Arrow of Arcane Interference\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Arcane_Interference\" title=\"Arrow of Arcane Interference\">Arrow of Arcane Interference</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Katana\" title=\"Katana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Katana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\